This local module replaces github.com/mattn/go-localereader for OfficeCLI's
darwin/linux release targets.

The upstream v0.0.1 module declares MIT license terms in README.md but does
not ship a standalone LICENSE file. OfficeCLI only publishes darwin/linux CLI
archives, where go-localereader is a no-op reader. This replacement preserves
that no-op API surface and includes the MIT license text for dependency
scanners.
